   "summary": "A release about the app's own face, and about counting and finding what a model is made of. Every dialog, menu and button wears the app's dark look and can be seen on it, and a file chooser opens where you would look. A model has one part count, the pieces a builder takes out of the box, and Stress weighs a Technic model's pins and axles, the Cat D11 in seconds. Search finds a technique by its words and a part by its number, and a photo's part comes in its colour. Claude lays real pieces that do the job, where the model can hold them, and Instructions saves a PDF.",
