   "summary": "A release about building with others, and by any hand. Build together puts two people on one model at once, live, each with their own undo. The app works with a screen reader and the keyboard alone, and on a tablet by touch. Finding a part is quicker and surer: search ranks parts by how much real sets use them and answers to BrickLink's and Rebrickable's names and the element numbers printed in instructions, a photo of a part finds it, and the parts bin holds the worked constructions the assistant knows. A booklet saves itself as a PDF, and Sign in with orangecheck works on the desktop.",
